mattpocock-skills: Matt Pocock's engineering and productivity skills for coding
agents. Speedwave bundles 23 of these skills as the core skills named
`speedwave-<name>` under containers/claude-resources/skills/ (copied verbatim
except for renamed slash commands, glossary file names, working-file paths and
the issue-tracker templates; see docs/adr/ADR-087). The copies ship inside the
Speedwave application on macOS and Windows and are linked into the Claude
container at start.

Upstream: https://github.com/mattpocock/skills
Plugin: mattpocock-skills 1.2.3 (claude-plugins-official marketplace)
Source commit: 84fdeff
